+## OpenStorm .163 stdio descriptor ownership
+
+**Isolated stdio startup on macOS.** The language server releases unrelated inherited streams before starting its workers, so another tool can finish reading its input while PHPantom stays running. Standard LSP input/output remain available. Contributed by @thinkycz.
+
 ## OpenStorm .162 resource middleware exclusions
 
 **Resource middleware navigation.** Names passed to `withoutMiddlewareFor()` navigate to their application registrations, auth guards and abilities, with hover and references. Route-method selectors and custom overrides do not borrow middleware semantics. Contributed by @thinkycz.
